ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/202609082323038476_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/202609082323038476_720.jpg"> </div><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-09/match2272600date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马丁内斯超巨失误送礼！皇马2-1国米 姆巴佩82破门库尔图瓦屡救险</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-09/6aa0204933c72native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧冠回归！新赛季首份积分榜：皇马、曼城、多特、维拉全取3分</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260909/zhanbao_image_2272600_1788901010_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260909/zhanbao_image_2272600_1788901010_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260909/zhanbao_image_2272600_1788901010_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>皇马主场2-1战胜国米取得新赛季欧冠开门红，本场姆巴佩、巴尔韦德、奥古斯托破门，何塞普·马丁内斯超巨失误。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-09/match2272630date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧冠开门红！曼城2-0客胜波尔图 哈兰德双响恩佐曼城生涯首助</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_