57_1788900971_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>多特主场3-2击败比利亚雷亚尔，取得欧冠开门红，吉拉西双响并自摆乌龙。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-09/match2272781date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">开门红！维拉3-2布鲁日 杰克逊首球麦金布恩迪亚破门 索默送空门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.67" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260909/zhanbao_image_2272781_1788892145_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.67" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.67" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260909/zhanbao_image_2272781_1788892145_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260909/zhanbao_image_2272781_1788892145_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>欧冠首轮，布鲁日2-3不敌阿斯顿维拉。维拉凭借麦金、布恩迪亚和杰克逊的进球，拿下欧冠首战。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-09/match2272798date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧冠-贝蒂斯客场3-2逆转十人里尔 小姆巴佩肘击染红 巴尔特拉双响</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.67" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260909/zhanbao_image_2272798_1788899986_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.67" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.67" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260909/zhanbao_image_2272798_1788899986_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260909/zhanbao_image_2272798_1788899986_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>贝蒂斯客场3-2逆转十人里尔，取得欧冠开门红。本场巴尔特拉双响，上田绮世破门，伊桑·姆巴佩染红。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-09/match2272822date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧冠-雅典AEK 1-0 LASK林茨 马林任意球制胜约维奇进球被吹</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260909/zhanbao_image_2272822_1788891705_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260909/zhanbao_image_2272822_1788891705_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260909/zhanbao_image_2272822_1788891705_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>雅典AEK主场1-0击败LASK林茨，马林任意球制胜。</p><p>【金球奖相关】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-08/6a9fae5566c67native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">金球奖30人候选：凯恩、罗德里、梅西姆巴佩亚马尔入围，巴黎10人</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/202609082248241965.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/202609082248241965.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/202609082248241965.jpg"> </div><p>金球奖官方今天公布2026男子金球奖30人候选名单，凯恩、梅西、姆巴佩、亚马尔在列，哈兰德、维尼修斯、罗德里、赖斯、登贝莱入围，拉菲尼亚、佩德里落选。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-08/6a9fb5db30c2anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">39岁仍在列！梅西时隔两届入围金球奖候选 生涯17次提名&amp;8次获奖</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.38" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/202609081526038558_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.38" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.38" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/202609081526038558_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260908/202609081526038558_1280.jpg"> </div><p>2026年金球奖候选名单已经公布，梅西第17次入选。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-08/6aa01f5196de2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">41岁C罗连续4年无缘金球奖候选，曾18次获提名历史最多+5次获奖</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260822/6a8893b62ae9b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type=